      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "So `poll(POLLIN)` on Windows would wake up and report urgent data? 😒 What about using `poll(POLLRDNORM)` on all platforms? Would that be consistent to ignore urgent data on all platforms?",
      "user": {
        "login": "vasild",
        "id": 266751,
        "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI2Njc1MQ==",
